  "prefLabel": "Puc 902.28 Witness Test",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 902.28 “Witness Test” means the process used by the electric distribution utility following the interconnection of a customer-generator’s facility to determine whether the interconnection affects the safety, reliability, or power quality of the utility’s distribution system.\n\nSource. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.19); ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.28)",
